/* ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
   MOBILE RESPONSIVE — internal screen layouts (≤ 600px)
   Stacks page header, scrolls sub-tabs/tables horizontally, wraps
   filter rows, collapses multi-col grids and reduces page/card pad.
